sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as API client
    participant P as Go Reverse Proxy
    participant S as Active policy snapshot
    participant CP as FastAPI Control Plane
    participant R as Redis rate limiter
    participant U as Protected upstream

    C->>P: HTTP request + X-API-Key + Bearer JWT
    P->>S: Is direct peer IP blocked?
    alt Blocked IP
        P-->>C: 403 IP_BLOCKED
    else Not blocked
        P->>S: Match METHOD + RequestURI against threat rules
        alt Threat match
            P-->>C: 403 THREAT_DETECTED
        else No threat
            P->>CP: Validate API key over internal REST
            alt Key missing / invalid / revoked / expired
                P-->>C: 401 or 403 structured error
            else Active key + exact scopes
                P->>S: Validate JWT signature, expiry, issuer, audience
                alt JWT invalid
                    P-->>C: 401 JWT_* error
                else JWT valid
                    P->>S: Match exact method and path, then require exact scope
                    alt Required scope absent
                        P-->>C: 403 INSUFFICIENT_SCOPE
                    else Authorised
                        P->>R: Apply key > route > global rule atomically
                        alt Limit exceeded
                            P-->>C: 429 + Retry-After + rate headers
                        else Allowed
                            P->>U: Forward cloned request without Aegis credentials
                            U-->>P: Upstream response
                            P-->>C: Response + rate metadata
                        end
                    end
                end
            end
        end
    end
    P-->>CP: Asynchronously report one sanitised terminal event
